  "goodToKnow": "Die Selbstbestimmung is self-determination: das Selbstbestimmungsrecht der Völker, ein selbstbestimmtes Leben. In 1983 Germany's Constitutional Court created the right to informationelle Selbstbestimmung, the right to control one's personal data, a foundation of German data protection. The Selbstbestimmungsgesetz of November 2024 lets people change their registered gender by declaration. It has no plural."
